          "$= (2 + 2\\sqrt{2} - 7)(2 + 2\\sqrt{2} + 1)$",
          "$= (2\\sqrt{2} - 5)(2\\sqrt{2} + 3)$",
          "$= 2\\sqrt{2} \\times 2\\sqrt{2} + 3 \\times 2\\sqrt{2} - 5 \\times 2\\sqrt{2} - 15$",
          "$= 8 + 6\\sqrt{2} - 10\\sqrt{2} - 15$"
        ],
        "result": "F = -4\\sqrt{2} - 7"
